<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Lilco price target raised to $27.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Lilco price target raised to $27.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- NatWest Securities said it raised its price target on Long Island Lighting Co to $27 a share from $25.</p>
<p>-- NatWest said the proposed merger of Lilco and Brooklyn Union Gas Co will create an extremely attractive company that may eventually become a takeover candidate.</p>
<p>-- NatWest maintained its trading buy rating on Lilco.</p>
<p>((-- Wall Street Desk 212-859-1730))</p>
</text>
